WEBVTT

00:00:03.670 --> 00:00:05.100
Welcome!

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:08.330
It’s full again today!

00:00:08.330 --> 00:00:11.070
Busy, busy. Busy, busy.

00:00:11.500 --> 00:00:16.780
I’m glad that now at the end of the year our
fruits daifuku kagami-mochi is popular.

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:22.850
Strawberry, banana and grenadine daifuku, please!

00:00:22.850 --> 00:00:24.710
Melon and mint flavor for me, please!

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:26.750
Yes, yes, immediately!

00:00:27.560 --> 00:00:29.950
I wish hat least had some time off
during school’s winter break.

00:00:29.950 --> 00:00:31.170
So true...

00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:36.140
Everyone, what are you talking about?

00:00:36.860 --> 00:00:39.850
No problem! Not too many customers!

00:00:40.490 --> 00:00:43.140
Sorry about making you wait!

00:00:43.140 --> 00:00:46.150
Enjoy your meal!

00:00:46.150 --> 00:00:50.630
They say girls change after Christmas. How true!

00:00:56.380 --> 00:01:00.340
The time of my awakening is near.

00:01:00.340 --> 00:01:04.600
Soon it will be time to complete the
plan of human extermination.

00:01:05.850 --> 00:01:08.350
If you continue to fail me,

00:01:08.350 --> 00:01:13.740
I won’t be able to help but doubt your abilities and loyalty towards me.

00:01:14.270 --> 00:01:16.480
Even though you say that,

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:19.600
we keep trying to get the Mew Aqua, but
the Mew Mew girls always get in the–

00:01:19.600 --> 00:01:22.060
I don’t have time to listen to your excuses.

00:01:22.970 --> 00:01:25.020
I’ve already developed a plan.

00:01:25.620 --> 00:01:29.300
This time, I will crush Tokyo Mew Mew.

00:01:31.420 --> 00:01:32.790
What’s that?

00:01:32.790 --> 00:01:35.190
A new sort of Chimera Anima.

00:01:35.190 --> 00:01:37.150
With its help, we will defeat the Mew Mew girls.

00:01:37.560 --> 00:01:40.120
But it looks... normal.

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:43.430
Heh. This one has a special ability.

00:01:43.430 --> 00:01:45.830
The ability to manipulate dreams.

00:01:45.830 --> 00:01:47.790
Manipulate dreams?

00:01:47.790 --> 00:01:51.010
Yes. Humans dream while sleeping.

00:01:51.010 --> 00:01:54.960
This Chimera Anima can manipulate those dreams any way it wants.

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:55.760
Hmmm.

00:01:55.760 --> 00:01:59.940
A dream is a world in another dimension,
generated by a human heart.

00:01:59.940 --> 00:02:02.680
Don’t you think that’s a good place for a graveyard?

00:02:02.680 --> 00:02:05.240
Heh. That sounds interesting.

00:02:05.240 --> 00:02:07.690
That’s just the revenge for Quiche.

00:02:15.290 --> 00:02:20.010
Those foolish humans built up this
city and polluted the Earth.

00:02:20.840 --> 00:02:26.190
How many thousands of years have our people been dreaming... about this place?

00:02:29.220 --> 00:02:34.240
They sent us here with the hope of salvation.

00:02:35.100 --> 00:02:41.080
I’ve been doing my best not to let them down.

00:02:43.740 --> 00:02:44.950
And yet...

00:02:46.070 --> 00:02:46.890
Yet...

00:02:47.580 --> 00:02:49.980
Nothing goes right.

00:02:49.980 --> 00:02:52.810
My plan should have been perfect.

00:02:52.810 --> 00:02:55.230
Even if someone strikes back...

00:02:55.230 --> 00:02:57.510
...it should have been easy to finish them off.

00:03:05.590 --> 00:03:07.620
Why did it turn out like this?

00:03:15.940 --> 00:03:16.500
Ichigo...

00:03:19.190 --> 00:03:20.420
Ichigo...

00:03:33.350 --> 00:03:35.440
They’re very fresh.
Come and buy some!

00:03:44.670 --> 00:03:46.130
It’s a white ball.

00:03:46.130 --> 00:03:48.010
The 4th prize.
You won a special towel.

00:03:48.010 --> 00:03:49.450
Thank you very much!

00:03:52.890 --> 00:03:54.640
Ehh!?

00:03:54.640 --> 00:03:57.360
A ski trip! For a couple!

00:04:17.210 --> 00:04:19.130
The snow is so powdery, isn’t it?

00:04:19.130 --> 00:04:22.470
Yup. My hands are frozen, though.

00:04:23.800 --> 00:04:26.030
Ichigo, give me your hands.

00:04:29.180 --> 00:04:30.930
Come closer, Ichigo.

00:04:30.930 --> 00:04:34.100
Aoyama-kun. You’re so warm.

00:04:34.100 --> 00:04:36.040
Happiness!

00:04:41.360 --> 00:04:43.320
Yes!

00:04:43.320 --> 00:04:45.620
I WILL get that first prize!

00:04:47.050 --> 00:04:49.510
Er, go ahead, please.

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:03.860
Congratulations!
You won the special prize!

00:05:03.860 --> 00:05:08.800
Eh? Special prize!? I did it!

00:05:08.800 --> 00:05:11.160
Wow! We can go skiing!

00:05:11.160 --> 00:05:12.940
Congrats!

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:26.590
NOOO!!!

00:05:26.590 --> 00:05:31.560
What the heck is this? Who’d want
“Shishimai Dance Mask & Costume”?

00:05:34.670 --> 00:05:36.520
I guess this is the last time we’ll meet this year.

00:05:37.120 --> 00:05:40.670
Somehow... this year seemed
like a dream.

00:05:40.670 --> 00:05:44.490
Lots of things have happened. So, sometimes I think...

00:05:45.340 --> 00:05:48.950
...that everything that’s happened up
to now has just been my dream...

00:05:48.950 --> 00:05:54.160
...and if I woke up, you wouldn’t even know my name...

00:05:54.550 --> 00:05:56.640
That can’t be.

00:05:56.640 --> 00:05:57.680
Why not?

00:05:57.680 --> 00:06:00.390
Though I was pretending to be
indifferent towards you,

00:06:00.390 --> 00:06:03.400
I always found you attractive, ever since I entered this school.

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:05.130
Really?

00:06:05.690 --> 00:06:09.740
And I was happy you came to watch me practice.

00:06:18.830 --> 00:06:22.520
I made a promise, right?
That I’d hide you.

00:06:24.710 --> 00:06:30.260
Happy new year, Aoyama-kun...

00:06:44.410 --> 00:06:46.400
I’ve done my work perfectly.

00:06:46.400 --> 00:06:47.980
Same here.

00:06:47.980 --> 00:06:51.180
If we succeed then Deep Blue-sama will forgive us.

00:06:52.030 --> 00:06:54.890
I’ll get my revenge on you,
Mew Mew girls. Just you wait.

00:06:54.890 --> 00:07:00.710
We will get rid of Tokyo Mew Mew,
the enemy blocking our plan.

00:07:01.440 --> 00:07:04.120
OK, then let’s go to hatsumoude together.

00:07:04.120 --> 00:07:06.860
Yeah! Have a good start to your New Year, Aoyama-kun!

00:07:06.860 --> 00:07:09.110
You too, Ichigo.

00:07:10.570 --> 00:07:13.030
Ah. I’m looking forward
to hatsumoude!

00:07:14.970 --> 00:07:18.000
Hmm, your date is over already?

00:07:18.930 --> 00:07:20.210
Eh? You!?

00:07:25.900 --> 00:07:27.170
Wait!

00:07:31.480 --> 00:07:33.220
Where are you? Show yourself?

00:07:45.410 --> 00:07:48.280
Uwah! What– What’s happening!?

00:07:49.340 --> 00:07:52.930
Don’t worry. We’re not going to kill you for now.

00:07:53.840 --> 00:07:55.560
Ah! It’s a Chimera Anima!

00:08:05.040 --> 00:08:07.690
Untie me. Untie me. I say.

00:08:07.690 --> 00:08:08.730
Untie me. Untie me. I say.

00:08:08.730 --> 00:08:15.050
Un...tie...m... I feel... sleepy...

00:08:23.290 --> 00:08:26.210
Heh! I’m taking your dream!

00:08:28.210 --> 00:08:31.970
Mew Mews! This is finally going to be the end of you!

00:08:49.100 --> 00:08:51.210
Everyone! Let’s call it a day!

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.980
Ah, Ichigo-san.

00:08:52.980 --> 00:08:57.490
I thought you would be back later because
of your date with Aoyama-oniisan.

00:08:57.490 --> 00:08:59.930
Is that bouquet a present?

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:03.400
Well, you could call it that.

00:09:04.330 --> 00:09:06.580
I thought they’d be nice
for the store.

00:09:06.580 --> 00:09:10.130
Today is the last business day of the year. I’ll work hard!

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:15.360
Ichigo-oneechan is full
of power again.

00:09:26.890 --> 00:09:28.860
So everyone, good work today!

00:09:29.540 --> 00:09:33.010
Ehh, we can eat all that?

00:09:34.920 --> 00:09:38.430
Of course! Eat whatever you like.

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:43.850
All of you worked hard
today. Well done!

00:09:43.850 --> 00:09:46.060
Well done!

00:09:46.060 --> 00:09:47.390
Cheers!

00:09:52.360 --> 00:09:54.840
All our efforts this year have been well-rewarded.

00:09:54.840 --> 00:09:56.430
Indeed!

00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:57.570
Bu-Ling feels dreamy!

00:09:57.570 --> 00:09:59.690
Let me dance!

00:09:59.060 --> 00:10:00.780
Bu-Ling-san!

00:10:14.480 --> 00:10:17.510
It’s about time to start the operation.

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:20.910
Ahh, I’m so full. I really am.

00:10:21.740 --> 00:10:24.950
This was our last chance to eat cakes here this year.

00:10:24.950 --> 00:10:28.440
Anyway, my tummy is sooo full now.

00:10:30.790 --> 00:10:34.750
I guess I drank too much tea
with the cakes.

00:10:34.750 --> 00:10:38.360
Me too. I have to loosen my skirt.
I’ll be right back.

00:10:38.360 --> 00:10:40.260
I can’t fit anymore in at all.

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:42.320
Even my extra dessert stomach is full!

00:10:50.270 --> 00:10:52.460
Huh, what?

00:10:53.640 --> 00:10:55.420
Ahhhh!

00:11:01.090 --> 00:11:02.140
Aiiii!

00:11:02.650 --> 00:11:03.530
What was that?

00:11:03.530 --> 00:11:06.780
Those were Minto-oneechan’s and
Retasu-oneechan’s voices!

00:11:06.780 --> 00:11:08.630
It’s alright.

00:11:09.650 --> 00:11:12.900
You two will follow them in just a second.

00:11:14.870 --> 00:11:15.630
You!?

00:11:15.630 --> 00:11:17.190
Ichigo-oneechan?

00:11:31.970 --> 00:11:34.250
Look at the flowers!

00:11:37.940 --> 00:11:39.590
We’re getting sucked in!

00:11:55.330 --> 00:11:58.360
The foolish Mew Mews fell right into our hands!

00:11:58.810 --> 00:12:02.320
Momomiya Ichigo’s dream is our special trap.

00:12:07.180 --> 00:12:09.060
Where are we?

00:12:09.850 --> 00:12:13.310
Who can tell? It doesn’t look like the dressing room.

00:12:17.310 --> 00:12:17.790
Ichigo!?

00:12:18.690 --> 00:12:21.760
Welcome to my world of dreams.

00:12:32.330 --> 00:12:34.700
Hehe. Are you surprised?

00:12:34.700 --> 00:12:38.960
This one can change itself into the owner of
the dream – the dream which it manipulates.

00:12:38.960 --> 00:12:42.960
You got dragged into this place so
you won’t be able to run away.

00:12:42.960 --> 00:12:45.530
The real Ichigo is fast asleep.

00:12:46.420 --> 00:12:47.720
What does that..?

00:12:47.720 --> 00:12:50.930
As long as Ichigo doesn’t wake up,
you won’t be able to get out of this dream!

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:56.770
But well, she won’t wake up. Her ability
to make you sleep is pretty strong.

00:12:56.770 --> 00:13:00.530
Go for it, Chimera Anima! Get the girls!

00:13:01.360 --> 00:13:03.570
The lavender...

00:13:05.230 --> 00:13:08.700
...succubus pillow!

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:10.930
Eat this!

00:13:10.930 --> 00:13:14.750
What a huge pillow! Run!

00:13:21.040 --> 00:13:24.300
Even in a dream, we won’t let it catch us so easily.

00:13:24.300 --> 00:13:24.990
Yup!

00:13:25.670 --> 00:13:26.990
Mew Mew MINT

00:13:28.590 --> 00:13:29.660
Mew Mew LETTUCE

00:13:30.180 --> 00:13:31.730
Mew Mew PUDDING

00:13:34.680 --> 00:13:35.900
Mew Mew POMEGRANATE

00:13:43.800 --> 00:13:47.100
METAMORPHO-SE!

00:13:58.410 --> 00:14:00.270
I won’t let you do as you please!

00:14:00.920 --> 00:14:03.280
Reborn Mint Echo!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:09.410
The Echo’s coming back!

00:14:10.380 --> 00:14:11.560
No way...

00:14:15.540 --> 00:14:19.040
Reborn PuddingRings Inferno!

00:14:25.650 --> 00:14:26.860
No effect!?

00:14:26.860 --> 00:14:27.720
Bu-Ling-san!

00:14:31.650 --> 00:14:34.100
Haha, didn’t I tell you!?

00:14:34.540 --> 00:14:37.330
You’re inside a dream which this
Chimera Anima can manipulate!

00:14:37.330 --> 00:14:40.750
This is a world where everything happens as it wants!

00:14:42.580 --> 00:14:44.670
That can’t be...

00:14:46.690 --> 00:14:50.110
In any case, when we put an end to Mew
Ichigo’s life, everything will be over.

00:14:50.760 --> 00:14:52.450
Together with Mew Strawberry’s dream,

00:14:52.450 --> 00:14:56.080
the Tokyo Mew Mews will completely disappear from this world.

00:14:56.930 --> 00:15:00.610
But it’d be impolite not to pay back our debt.

00:15:00.610 --> 00:15:04.840
Now you’ll pay for Quiche a hundred –
no, a thousand times!

00:15:11.440 --> 00:15:17.100
So? How does it feel to have your friends
get hurt in your own dream-world?

00:15:29.960 --> 00:15:32.130
What should we do?

00:15:32.130 --> 00:15:34.470
We can’t fight like this!

00:15:34.470 --> 00:15:37.370
The only thing we can do is...
to wake up Ichigo!

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:46.720
Look at yourselves!
You’re getting what you deserve!

00:15:49.440 --> 00:15:54.140
Tart, that’s enough.
It’s time to let all five disappear.

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:00.410
This is...

00:16:01.040 --> 00:16:02.350
THE END!

00:16:05.220 --> 00:16:13.530
Ichigo! It’s her fault... that nothing ever
goes right. It’s her fault!! ICHIGO!

00:16:13.530 --> 00:16:17.020
Tokyo Mew Mews, DIE!

00:16:20.810 --> 00:16:21.370
What!?

00:16:22.140 --> 00:16:23.170
You!?

00:16:23.370 --> 00:16:25.580
I am the one who’ll destroy her!

00:16:27.850 --> 00:16:31.510
Ichigo! Wake up! Get up! Look at me!

00:16:33.990 --> 00:16:36.570
COME ON! Wake up and look at me!

00:16:36.570 --> 00:16:38.930
GET UP! Look at me, right here!

00:16:41.780 --> 00:16:42.600
Foolish...

00:16:51.540 --> 00:16:52.810
There’s..!

00:16:52.810 --> 00:16:54.960
Ichigo’s waking up! Now’s the time!

00:16:54.960 --> 00:16:55.640
Yes!

00:16:55.640 --> 00:16:56.690
Now!

00:16:58.630 --> 00:17:00.200
Quiche!

00:17:00.200 --> 00:17:01.900
Ichigo!

00:17:06.310 --> 00:17:09.380
Mew Mew Strawberry METAMORPHO-SE!

00:17:10.650 --> 00:17:13.510
Reborn Mint Echo!

00:17:14.300 --> 00:17:16.930
Reborn Lettuce Rush!

00:17:17.560 --> 00:17:21.270
Reborn PuddingRings Inferno!

00:17:21.270 --> 00:17:23.680
Reborn Pomegran’ Spear!

00:17:26.370 --> 00:17:27.790
Yay!

00:17:27.790 --> 00:17:29.360
Mew Strawberry, now!

00:17:46.100 --> 00:17:49.780
Reborn Strawberry SURPRISE!

00:17:58.530 --> 00:18:00.030
Everyone!

00:18:00.030 --> 00:18:02.070
We’re alright.

00:18:02.070 --> 00:18:03.310
But there are still enemies left.

00:18:05.280 --> 00:18:10.230
What a strange development. His strong
feelings woke up Mew Strawberry.

00:18:10.960 --> 00:18:12.440
Ichigo. Choose!

00:18:12.960 --> 00:18:15.470
Become mine, or...

00:18:16.050 --> 00:18:16.900
I’ll destroy you.

00:18:17.800 --> 00:18:18.870
What the...!

00:18:19.300 --> 00:18:22.890
If you want to stay alive,
you have to become mine.

00:18:26.260 --> 00:18:27.830
Stop talking nonsense!

00:18:31.980 --> 00:18:37.230
Listen to what I’m saying... dammit. Dammit...

00:18:37.230 --> 00:18:38.300
Quiche?

00:18:38.300 --> 00:18:39.780
Why...

00:18:40.360 --> 00:18:45.580
Why don’t you... listen to me?

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:47.660
Why... you...

00:18:47.660 --> 00:18:48.710
Ichigo...

00:18:51.580 --> 00:18:53.210
What a stupid thing to do.

00:18:53.210 --> 00:18:57.280
What an idiot. How could he have
such feelings for a human?

00:18:57.280 --> 00:19:03.240
How dare you use my dream and try to hurt my friends!

00:19:03.800 --> 00:19:04.700
Heh.

00:19:05.600 --> 00:19:06.660
What’s so funny?

00:19:06.660 --> 00:19:11.120
That’s why I always say you humans are selfish!

00:19:12.770 --> 00:19:19.550
You hurt Quiche as well! We too
are fighting for our friends!

00:19:19.550 --> 00:19:24.870
We have to exterminate the humans
of this planet as soon as possible.

00:19:32.710 --> 00:19:35.400
Our friends are waiting on our planet.

00:19:35.400 --> 00:19:36.840
Planet...

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:38.360
Friends?

00:19:38.360 --> 00:19:40.550
Excuse us.

00:19:40.550 --> 00:19:42.850
I’m looking forward to our next fight.

00:19:45.550 --> 00:19:48.720
It seems that those people do have feelings...

00:19:48.720 --> 00:19:52.830
They’re concerned about their friends just as we are.

00:19:54.690 --> 00:19:57.520
Are we really selfish?

00:19:57.520 --> 00:19:58.830
People can be foolish...

00:20:00.070 --> 00:20:08.430
So we always have to look for the answer.
What is it that one really has to protect?

00:20:10.580 --> 00:20:11.940
Quiche...

00:20:24.390 --> 00:20:27.680
Thanks to Ichigo we had to suffer a lot today.

00:20:27.680 --> 00:20:31.430
I’m the victim here!
You’re saying it all wrong!

00:20:31.430 --> 00:20:37.230
All you do is think about your boyfriend and space out. The enemy takes advantage of it.

00:20:37.230 --> 00:20:39.810
More importantly, what are you going
to do as a preview of the next show?

00:20:39.810 --> 00:20:43.570
The next show? Well, it’ll be “The Two
are Friends. Bu-Ling in Danger”.

00:20:43.570 --> 00:20:47.570
But more importantly, it’s a bit unfair to say I’m always spacing out, don’t you think!?

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:50.820
This is what’s unfair! I’m playing the leading role next time,

00:20:50.820 --> 00:20:53.710
...but you didn’t even talk about me in the preview!
